### a stavka of the porudžbenica to take
select p.rproid::bigint, coalesce(p.sifra, 0)::int, coalesce(s.po, 0)::int, coalesce(p.rsifid, 0)::bigint, coalesce(p.trazkolic, 0)::float8, coalesce(p.cena, 0)::float8, coalesce(p.rab, 0)::float8 from epro p left join rsif s on s.rsifid = p.rsifid WHERE (p.rproid = $1) AND (p.rdokid = $2) AND (p.god = $3) AND (p.kar = $4)
[]interface {}{41, 25, 2026, 7}
in transaction: true

### the artikal is in the prijemnica
